Screen margins and the panel

Openbox keeps a 5px gap around windows (~/.config/openbox/rc.xml,
<margins>). tint2 reserves no space of its own (strut_policy = none in
~/.config/tint2/tint2rc), so the bottom margin covers the panel too:

    bottom margin = panel height + 5    (28 + 5 = 33)

If you change panel_size in tint2rc, update <bottom> to match, then
run: openbox --reconfigure
